ount가 같은 값으로 고정된 경우 일부 노드가 zone 장애로 NotReady 상태가 되어도 Cluster Autoscaler는 스케일업을 시도하지 않은 것이 맞을까요 ? (VMSS의 target instance count가 이미 max와 같기 때문에) 이 경우 실제로 여유 capacity를 확보하려면 --max-count를 올리는 것 외에 다른 방법이 있을까요 ?</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"en-US\">-&gt;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c82613;font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">답변</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"en-US\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">말씀</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">주신</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">내용은</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> Cluster Autoscaler&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">와는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">별개로</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> AKS&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">자체적으로</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> remediator&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">라는</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> self-healing&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">을</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">담당하는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">컴포넌트가</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">존재하기에</span><span lang=\"en-US\">,&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">이러한</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> not ready&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">된</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">노드에</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">대해</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">스스로</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">복구를</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">시도하게</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">됩니다</span><span lang=\"en-US\">.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">즉</span><span lang=\"en-US\">, Cluster autoscaler&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">의</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">동작과는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang